{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>and on the way</b> Four times in the Masorah: here, and the others: וילך בדרך אביו, ובדרך אמו, ובדרך ירבעם בן נבט, and the other: ובדרך חטאים לא עמד. And this one is ובדרך לא הי׳ וחדל לעשות הפסח — he acts in the manner that Jeroboam did, who went in the way of sinners who nullified the sacrifices and caused Israel to sin; this one too, who is not on the way and neglects to make the Passover." "<b>and neglects</b> Two times in the Masorah: here, and the other: וחדל לעולם. The Passover is in karet, and this one is וחדל לעולם — for the lifetime of the jubilee, i.e., fifty years, like the law of those liable to karet, who do not live past fifty." "<b>and that soul shall be cut off</b> ס\"\"ת אשה — to teach you that both a man and a woman are included in punishments."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:21:40.766494578Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}